				<r3d:description language="eng">NRCMM is a service platform that integrates preservation and supply of resources of model mice, creation and development of disease model, experimental animal personnel training as a whole. The mission of NRCMM is two-fold: to provide preservation, production, supply, information consultation that aim to benifit human health, and to provide multiple training for graduate students as well as scientists on using the model animals. Resource center  also provide service for experimental animal research and cooperation throughout China that will promote  leading position of our country in the related field and the development of related disciplines, such as life science, medical science and pharmacy.</r3d:description>
